/*
  IMPORTANT!
    This file is created by Nix on per-host basis, otherwise the configuration
    for one host could mis-configure the outputs of another host.

  Use `niri msg outputs` to check monitor names
    https://niri-wm.github.io/niri/Configuration:-Outputs

  Only required when setting multiple monitors. Output scale and rotation has
  to be taken into account for positioning. For example, a 3840×2160 output
  with scale 2.0 will have a logical size of 1920×1080, so to put another
  output directly adjacent to it on the right, set its x to 1920. If the
  position is unset or results in an overlap, the output is instead placed
  automatically.
*/
